@title Prescription Refill Flow
@subtitle Medora Health, integrations team reference. Version dated 2026-09-30

# Refill sequence

diagram refill sequence title="Refill request"
refill: app "Patient App" user
refill: svc "Refill Service" svc
refill: ehr "Clinic EHR" svc
refill: pharm "Pharmacy Portal" ext
refill: app -> svc : request refill
refill: svc -> ehr : check active prescription and refills left
refill: alt "clinic approves"
refill: ehr --> svc : approved, 2 refills remaining
refill: svc -> pharm : e-prescription, NCPDP SCRIPT
refill: pharm --> svc : accepted, ready in 2 hours
refill: svc --> app : refill confirmed
refill: else "clinic declines"
refill: ehr --> svc : denied, visit needed
refill: svc --> app : book a visit
refill: end

# Service targets

table = Call,Target; Clinic EHR check,within 3 s; Pharmacy acknowledgement,within 30 s; Confirmation shown in the app,within 10 s of the request

# Rules

!! **Controlled substances are never refilled through the app.**

- A refill covers at most a 90-day supply.
- Requests made after 21:00 wait in a queue until 07:00.
